        "heading": "Different alarm times. <em>Same bed.</em>",
        "text": "<p>Most couples don't get up at the same time. A phone alarm goes off for everyone in the room, and every snooze wakes them again. The Silent Wake Band buzzes on the wrist of whoever's getting up, so the other person sleeps until their own alarm.</p>",
